                  {
                    "@id": "ontomedia:scene_3_2",
                    "@type": "ontomedia:SceneSketch",
                    "ontomedia:name": "The Community Welcome",
                    "ontomedia:description": "A small gathering at Anna's café introduces Katrine to the community. She feels both the warmth of acceptance and the weight of expectation - they're welcoming her not just as a doctor, but as the granddaughter of their beloved healer. Sofia's presence adds a layer of complexity, as her traditional knowledge and deep connection to the island create both professional respect and personal tension. Anna, ever the community connector, helps bridge the gap between the two doctors, while Lily's artistic perspective offers a unique view of the island's healing traditions.",
                    "ontomedia:key_plot_point": "First community acceptance and professional tension",
                    "ontomedia:character_development": {
