                    "ontomedia:name": "The First Emergency",
                    "ontomedia:description": "A minor medical emergency tests Katrine's adaptation to island medicine. As she works alongside Mads, she feels the first real connection to her new role - not just as a doctor, but as part of this community.",
                    "ontomedia:key_plot_point": "First test of medical adaptation",
