                  {
                    "@id": "ontomedia:scene_7_3",
                    "@type": "ontomedia:SceneSketch",
                    "ontomedia:name": "The Community Stand",
                    "ontomedia:description": "The clinic transforms into a space of community support as patients share their experiences with Katrine's methods. Sofia's traditional remedies and Katrine's modern treatments are showcased through real patient stories, while Lily's sketches document the healing journey of each case. Jakob provides historical context for the island's medical traditions, and Anna's café has become a gathering place for residents sharing their support. The board members, observing from the sidelines, witness the seamless integration of traditional and modern medicine in action. The warmth of their testimonies creates a powerful counterpoint to the clinical investigation, as each story becomes a testament to the effectiveness of their integrated approach.",
