                  {
                    "@id": "ontomedia:scene_9_2",
                    "@type": "ontomedia:SceneSketch",
                    "ontomedia:name": "The Meeting",
                    "ontomedia:description": "At the town hall, the community gathers to discuss Katrine's proposed solution. The public forum becomes a celebration of island unity, as residents share their support for her innovative approach to combining tradition with progress. Sofia presents her traditional healing methods, demonstrating how they complement Katrine's modern approach. Lily's sketches of successful treatments are displayed around the hall, each one telling a story of healing that bridges old and new. Anna has prepared a special spread of traditional island dishes, creating a tangible connection between food, community, and healing. Jakob shares historical examples of how the island's medical traditions have evolved while maintaining their core values. The afternoon sun streams through the windows, illuminating both the challenges overcome and the promise of a new approach to island medicine. The medical board's representatives, initially skeptical, begin to see the value in their unique approach as they witness the seamless integration of traditional and modern medicine in action. The warmth of the community's support creates a powerful counterpoint to the clinical investigation, as each story becomes a testament to the effectiveness of their integrated approach.",
