                    "@type": "ontomedia:SceneSketch",
                    "ontomedia:name": "The Celebration",
                    "ontomedia:description": "The town square transforms into a celebration of the island's medical heritage and future. The community gathers to honor both Marie's legacy and Katrine's innovation, creating a perfect balance of tradition and progress. Sofia leads a demonstration of traditional healing methods, her movements graceful and precise as she shows how ancient wisdom complements modern medicine. Lily's sketches of their journey are displayed around the square, each one capturing a moment of growth and healing. Anna has prepared a feast of traditional island dishes, each recipe incorporating medicinal herbs and passed down through generations. Jakob shares stories of the island's medical history, connecting past healers to the present celebration. The research center's lights twinkle in the distance, its modern architecture harmonizing with the traditional buildings of the square. The medical board's representatives join in the celebration, their formal attire gradually giving way to island hospitality. The scent of medicinal herbs mixes with the aroma of traditional cooking, creating a perfect blend of healing and celebration. Children dance to traditional music, their laughter a testament to the island's vibrant future. The setting sun casts a golden light over the gathering, illuminating both the challenges overcome and the promise of new beginnings.",
