                    "@type": "ontomedia:SceneSketch",
                    "ontomedia:name": "The Dinner",
                    "ontomedia:description": "At Mads's family home, they celebrate the research center's success and their personal journey. The warm family setting becomes a space for personal connection, as they share their hopes for the future and strengthen their bonds. Lily's sketches of their journey together adorn the walls, each one telling a story of growth and connection. Anna has prepared a special dinner using traditional island recipes and medicinal herbs from the garden, creating a perfect blend of celebration and healing. Jakob shares stories of the island's history, connecting past generations to their present moment. The evening light streams through the windows, illuminating both the challenges overcome and the promise of their future together. The scent of traditional cooking mixes with the aroma of medicinal herbs from the garden, creating a perfect blend of family and healing. The family photos on the walls, showing generations of island life, provide a backdrop to their celebration of new beginnings.",
